  "body": "## What changed\nThe user guide in `site/` now covers the user-visible PRs merged after #1995 (through upstream/main `ce59ef446`). Fork synced at upstream main, no code changes.\n\nDocumented (page): #2094 AI Chat pane, #2028 (automate/mcp.md); #2059 Open example, #2000 camera frame on open, #2023 lathe view, #2027/#2086/#2095/#2097 theme tokens and accessibility labels (getting-started/first-run.md); #2061 Machines filter, #2099 WCS tilt guard, #1932 side-turn walls (set-up/setups.md); #2001 waterjet kind, #2006 envelope on table plane, #2062 Tormach lathe rigid tapping, #2103 -Z C axis (check-and-post/machines.md); #2079 Explain G-code switch (posting.md); #2029 tool Properties and Tool library pane, #2026 left-hand taps, #2010/#2041/#2020 tool editor (set-up/tools.md); #1954 Side Auto, #1935 picked-ring refusal, #2034 Slot Manual, #2040 expanded-bore refusals (operations-2d.md); #2084 STEP pass budget, #1930/#2107 machining mesh (reference pages).\n\nNo docs needed (no user control or no behaviour change): #1937 DXF reader and #2056 AC kinematics (library only, not wired to the app), #2098 test-only, #2085/#2075/#2052/#2111 tests or refactors, #2080/#2058/#2046/#2053 already docs/site, #2117 process, #1920 (page already in the guide).\n\nNot documented, by instruction: unmerged #2112, #2114, #2116, #2106, #2092, #2083, #2077, #2054, #1817, #1753.\n\n#1949 is NOT fixed here: the AI Chat pane has no live transport (#1945 open), so provider setup and worked examples would describe controls that do not exist. The pane's shipped controls and that limit are in the MCP page.\n\n## Tests\n`python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests` (24 tests: Release022Guide, GuideNavigation, OperationReferencePictures, new `GuideAfter1995`), `zola build` in `site/` clean. `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` plans no crate tests (nothing in `crates/` changed).\n\nNot exercised: the app UI itself; strings were checked against source.\nChangelog: none\nEffort: medium\nFixes #2118\n",
